# SYNOPSIS

```text
protocol todhchai.radharc.Compositor version 1
call screen() -> ScreenInfo
call open(title: String, width: UInt32, height: UInt32)
  throws(WindowError) -> Opened
call openView(title: String, width: UInt32, height: UInt32)
  throws(WindowError) -> OpenedView
```

